{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Obnoxiously_tedious)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Obnoxiously tedious)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/4979f48c39324925c22031079f03410ffff35395.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] real s=sqrt(3)/2; draw(box((0,0),(1,1))); draw((1+s,0.5)--(1,1)); draw((1+s,0.5)--(1,0)); draw((0,1)--(1+s,0.5)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(1,1),N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(1,0),S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(0,0),W); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(0,1),W); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(1+s,0.5),E); //Credit to TheMaskedMagician for the diagram[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"155\" />\n</p><p>In the adjoining figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd85454c0ce4000c0e63b4a1c4a12ef6f8b56e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is an equilateral triangle and point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is outside square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. \nWhat is the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/f/48fe86780ad44097d1fb8227f2ab4f325f5bc27c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle AED$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> in degrees?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b9c891c42f6bcb8de8d4a96964c5d363899697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }10\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }12.5\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }15\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }20\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/1/eb1c4e1b51bc98ab8d7fccb781a18908746f9b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle DAE = 90^\\circ+60^\\circ = 150^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"212\" height=\"14\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f666e2e651aedf38b50ead09d8bb15cb3871be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = AE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />. Then triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70422100db8de33f8e5e0ab5062c5bb6a5ac969d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is isosceles, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f511495193bf208a98a1b26466c49e3b1e2e373d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle AED = \\dfrac{180^\\circ-150^\\circ}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"266\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Obnoxiously_tedious.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Obnoxiously_tedious)\">Solution 2 (Obnoxiously tedious)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Obnoxiously tedious)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, let the side length of the square and the equilateral triangle be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/7/75772389e767c56858e8456abb909c866d6cec4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{DAE}=90^\\circ+60^\\circ=150^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"216\" height=\"16\" />. Apply the law of cosines then the law of sines, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/e/29e6a08630db7ecee5d721f3d67ddfd5fc456e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{AED}=15^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />. Select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>Please don't try this solution. This is just obnoxiously tedious and impractical.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FDgcLW4frg8?t=1341\">https://youtu.be/FDgcLW4frg8?t=1341</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n